<title>GREECE: NATL MORTGAGE'S EQUITY-LINKED NOTE RAISED 2.7BLN DRS.</title>
<headline>NATL MORTGAGE'S EQUITY-LINKED NOTE RAISED 2.7BLN DRS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Mortgage Bank's one-year 3.0 percent equity linked note based on a basket of six Athens stock exchange blue chip stocks raised around 2.7 billion drachmas.</p>
<p>The basket which has historically outperformed the general share index includes OTE telecom , Alpha Credit, Hellenic Bottling , National Bank , Titan Cement and National Mortgage .</p>
<p>&quot;The issue went well given the market's upside potential,&quot; said Dimitris Papadopoulos, head of corporate finance at Sigma Securities, arranger of the issue.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
